        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squirrel Idle Tycoon is a relaxing, addictive idle game where you build a thriving squirrel-powered empire from the ground up. Start in the Production Bay, gathering ice, melting it into water, and selling it for acorns as you slowly grow your resources. As your operation expands, you’ll hire hardworking squirrels to automate your workflow, boost production, and keep earning even while you’re offline. Each new upgrade increases your efficiency, lets you scale faster, and unlocks new business opportunities as your tiny ice-and-water startup becomes a full forest-scale enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression revolves around constant improvement: bigger numbers, faster production, stronger multipliers, and a steady flow of acorns that never stops rising. When you’re ready, you can take the ultimate leap by prestiging—resetting your empire in exchange for Golden Acorns, a rare currency that grants permanent boosts and lets every future run grow exponentially quicker. Your upgrades, achievements, and prestige shop combine into a satisfying loop of growth, reset, and explosive progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a clean interface, charming squirrel personality, and passive offline gains, Squirrel Idle Tycoon offers a calm yet rewarding experience perfect for fans of idle progression games. Whether you love optimizing production chains, watching numbers climb, or simply enjoying the chaos of a squirrel workforce doing their best, this game delivers a fun and endlessly scalable journey from tiny drips to unstoppable riches.</p>",
